      "description": "Refusals that WOULD NOT have happened without the delivery-machinery reserve: the write fitted against the tenant's raw ceiling and was refused only by the headroom the reserve holds back. The reserve doing its job — but a standing rate means the ceiling or the reserve wants tuning. Alerted as CommandBatchReserveRefusals (warning).",
