    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Batch cancels by disposition",
      "description": "What pulling the brake on a fleet write actually caught, per command. cancelled: stopped before the device saw it. already_sent: physically actuated — cancelling would stop nothing and would only discard the device's real answer. already_finished: terminal before the cancel arrived. A cancel with almost everything in already_sent means the brake is being pulled too late to be a brake.",
